HELP [topic]

Shows help on a command. Type HELP and the name of a command, such as
HELP DIRECTORY. A command name may be shortened, as on the command line.

Commands:
  DIRECTORY  TYPE      COPY      DELETE    RENAME    CREATE
  SET        SHOW      HELP      RUN       LOGIN     LOGOUT
  ROBCO      DEVICE    HOLOTAPE  MAIL      AUTHORIZE

Keys at the prompt: Enter runs the line, Ctrl-C clears it, UP and DOWN
recall earlier lines. A line that ends with - goes on to the next line.
Ctrl-C also stops a long command, such as a COPY.
